RULES-NEXT: 0x00000000 00000000 00000000 03100000 05200000
RULES: Hex dump of section '.debug_ranges':
RULES-NEXT: 0x00000000 33333333 33333333
RULES: Hex dump of section '.debug_other':
RULES-NEXT: 0x00000000 33333333

ZERO: Hex dump of section '.debug_renamed':
ZERO-NEXT: 0x00000000 00000000 00000000 03100000 05200000
ZERO: Hex dump of section '.debug_ranges':
ZERO-NEXT: 0x00000000 00000000 00000000
ZERO: Hex dump of section '.debug_other':
