META-NEXT: 0x00000010 33333333 03100000 05200000

QUIET-NOT: {{[Ww]arning}}

RELOCS: Relocation section '{{\.rela?}}.debug_loc' {{.*}} contains 4 entries:
RELOCS: {{R_[A-Z0-9_]+}} {{.*}} dead
RELOCS: {{R_[A-Z0-9_]+}} {{.*}} dead
RELOCS: {{R_[A-Z0-9_]+}} {{.*}} _start
RELOCS: {{R_[A-Z0-9_]+}} {{.*}} absolute
